From: OpenWrt Build System <openwrt@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ssdk: serialize and retire FDB work and control producers

Own delayed/IRQ/control producers and preserve the last private waitqueue
use under its state lock; final drain synchronizes even without IN_FDB.
This does not certify legacy PHY/DSA/cache or complete module/FW retirement.

